VERSION = "v0.33.0"
RELEASE_NOTE = "Offline migration fix + VM power UX. Fix: offline migration of a stopped VM no longer fails with 'missing features: <CPU feature>' (e.g. MPX) — the source host's expanded CPU feature list from 'virsh dumpxml --migratable' is reset to the portable host-model form before defining on the target, so the destination resolves CPU features against its own host (topology preserved; live-migration and HA-recover paths unchanged). UI: hard-stop 'Force off' (virsh destroy) now available for RUNNING VMs with a data-loss confirm; VM detail page gains a state-driven power actions bar (start/stop/force off/reboot/suspend/resume). UI branding is a runtime BRANDING toggle (default KVMaestro; set BRANDING to a custom preset to white-label)."
